        "disposition": "retained",
        "target_ids": [
          "D1"
        ],
        "reason": "Retained causal relation, rival, predictions, constraints, uncertainty and complete probe/defeat conditions."
      }
    ],
    "decision": "Retain for investigation only if construction and timing are realizable. No deployment follows."
